  "ruleText": "Agr 1807.01 Form A-1 Application for Apiary Registration. Any applicant owning or possessing honey bees in New Hampshire may register hives with the department of agriculture, markets, and food by completing and submitting Form A-1 “Application for Apiary Registration”, amended 5-22-24.\n\nSource. #13978, eff 5-23-24",
